  "title": "Notify When Found",
  "summary": "Glen confirms June never went anywhere without her phone and that it wasn't among the effects the police returned. Cst. Leah Morrison notes the message but says the file is closed and suggests suspending the line. Owen calls it a prank and gets oddly defensive. Tess remembers June's phone is on her Family Sharing and turns on Find My's \"Notify When Found\".",
  "status": "final",
  "cliffhanger": "Find My: June's iPhone is found near Port Ardoise Regional High School at 12:14 PM.",
