      "messages": [
        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t01",
          "label": "Tue, Feb 2 at 7:12 PM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Glen, can I ask you some things about her phone? One at a time."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "Of course dear..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "1. When did you last see it?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "The morning of the 12th... in her cardigan pocket like always. The green one. She never left it on a table in her life... said tables are where phones go to get sat on"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "2. The police returned her things. Was it in the bag?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "No. Her glasses, her watch, the cardigan... no phone. I asked the young constable and she wrote it down"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "3. Did you ever try ringing it?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "Every night for a week... it went to her message. Then I stopped because hearing her was WORSE"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "sorry. caps"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Don't be sorry."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "glen",
          "text": "\"She wasnt alone.\" I was at the bonspiel Tess. I should have been home"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m12",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "You couldn't have known, Glen."
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "Glen: the phone was always in her cardigan."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "type": "conversation",
      "theme": "light",
      "exportProfile": "iphone",
      "presentation": {
        "statusBar": {
          "time": "9:21"
        }
      },
      "deviceOwner": "tess",
      "participants": [
        "tess",
        "leah"
      ],
      "messages": [
        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t01",
          "label": "Wed, Feb 3 at 9:05 AM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Cst. Morrison, this is Tess Pellerin, June Pellerin's niece and executor. We spoke on January 13. I need to report something."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "leah",
          "text": "Good morning Ms. Pellerin. Go ahead."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "Yesterday at 12:31 PM a message was sent from June's mobile number to our family group chat: \"she wasnt alone.\" Her phone was not among her effects."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "tess",
          "attachment": {
            "type": "image",
            "label": "Screenshot",
            "detail": "Pellerins 🦞 · Feb 2, 12:31 PM"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "leah",
          "text": "Thank you. I've noted it on the file. The effects list doesn't include a phone, that's correct."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "So someone has it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "leah",
          "text": "Someone has the phone or the number. SIMs get reused. People are sometimes cruel after a death, more often than you'd think."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "leah",
          "text": "The medical examiner's finding was accidental and the file is closed. I'd recommend reporting the device lost and suspending the line."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "If I suspend the line, I lose the only person who has said anything about that night."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "leah",
          "text": "Understood. If you receive anything threatening or specific, call the detachment."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "tess",
          "text": "I'll keep a record. To the minute."
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "The RCMP: file closed."
      }
    },
